":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTraditional":"積年，八十七萬六千五百七。","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_39_223","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTraditional":"日法，二萬三千四百六十","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_39_224","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTraditional":"《大象歷》大象元年己亥冯顯造，行五年，至隋开皇甲辰，後天十刻。","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_39_225","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTraditional":"積年，四萬二千二百五十五。","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_39_226","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTraditional":"日法，一萬二千九百九十二。","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_39_227","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTraditional":"《开皇歷》隋开皇四年甲辰張賓造，行二十四年，至大業戊辰，後天七刻。","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_39_228","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTraditional":"積年，四百一十二萬九千六百九十七。","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_39_229","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTraditional":"日法，一十萬二千九百六十。","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_39_230","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTraditional":"《大業歷》大業四年戊辰張胄元造，行一十一年，至唐武德己卯，後天七刻。","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_39_231","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTraditional":"積年，一百四十二萬八千三百一十七。","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_39_232","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTraditional":"日法，一千一百四十四。","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_39_233","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTraditional":"《戊寅歷》唐武德二年己卯道士傅仁均造，行四十六年，至麟德乙丑，後天四十七刻。","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_39_234","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTraditional":"積年，一十六萬五千三。","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_39_235","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTraditional":"日法一萬三千六百。","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_39_236","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTraditional":"《麟德歷》麟德二年乙丑李淳風造，行六十三年，至开元戊辰，後天一十二刻。","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_39_237","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_39","textTradi